SUMMARY:GitHub Copilot Dev Days Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Enterprise DevOps User Group\n**REGISTER AT [https://l
 uma.com/5mthp0p6](https://luma.com/5mthp0p6)** instead of Meetup for this 
 event\\*\\*.\\*\\* This event takes place at Microsoft Headquarters buildi
 ng which requires attendees to register using provided link to get QR code
  to a unique QR Code in order to enter the Microsoft Headquarters.\n\nPlan
 ning is underway. RSVP now to reserve your spot. Space is limited.\n\nDev 
 Days is a global\, in-person\, community-led experience bringing developer
 s\, DevOps enthusiasts\, and local tech communities together to discover w
 hat’s possible with GitHub Copilot.\nThis isn’t your typical conferenc
 e talk series. It’s a hands-on opportunity to explore real-world workflo
 ws\, practical use cases\, and the latest ways to put GitHub Copilot to wo
 rk.\n\nJoin us for interactive demos\, hands-on activities\, and workshops
  focused on GitHub Copilot — and leave with practical skills\, ideas\, a
 nd techniques you can start using right away.\n\nCome curious. Get hands-o
 n. Build something. See what GitHub Copilot can really do.\n\nEvent is co-
 hosted with Microsoft and North Toronto Cloud & DevOps User Group.
